<p style=3D"-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; lin=
e-height: 1.4; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; =
color: #000000; text-align: left; margin: 0 0 15px;" align=3D"left"><span d=
ata-olk-copy-source=3D"MessageBody" style=3D"line-height: 1.4;">Last year, =
President Donald J. Trump signed into law the Working Families Tax Cuts, la=
ndmark legislation that ushered in a new era of tax relief and prevented th=
e largest tax increase in American history from taking effect. This past fi=
ling season over 110 million refunds were issued, and <strong>over 67 milli=
on filers</strong> took advantage of at least one tax break from the Workin=
g Families Tax Cuts:</span></p>
<ul type=3D"disc" style=3D"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 15px;">
<li style=3D"-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; li=
ne-height: 1.4; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;=
 color: #000000; text-align: left; margin-top: 0px;">No tax on tips;</li>
<li style=3D"-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; li=
ne-height: 1.4; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;=
 color: #000000; text-align: left;">No tax on overtime;</li>
<li style=3D"-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; li=
ne-height: 1.4; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;=
 color: #000000; text-align: left;">No tax on car loan interest (for qualif=
ying vehicles);</li>
<li style=3D"-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; li=
ne-height: 1.4; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;=
 color: #000000; text-align: left; margin-bottom: 15px;">Or an enhanced ded=
uction for America=E2=80=99s seniors.</li>
</ul>
<p style=3D"-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; lin=
e-height: 1.4; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; =
color: #000000; text-align: left; margin: 0 0 15px;" align=3D"left">These n=
ew provisions enabled working and older Americans to keep more of their har=
d-earned money.</p>
<ul type=3D"disc" style=3D"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 15px;">
<li style=3D"-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; li=
ne-height: 1.4; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;=
 color: #000000; text-align: left; margin-top: 0px;">More than <strong>30 m=
illion</strong> workers claimed the <strong>No Tax on Overtime</strong> ded=
uction with an average benefit of <strong>over $3,100</strong>
</li>
<li style=3D"-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; li=
ne-height: 1.4; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;=
 color: #000000; text-align: left;">More than <strong>38 million</strong> A=
mericans 65 and older claimed the <strong>enhanced senior deduction</strong=
> with an average deduction of <strong>over $7,500</strong>
</li>
<li style=3D"-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; li=
ne-height: 1.4; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;=
 color: #000000; text-align: left;">Nearly <strong>8 million </strong>worke=
rs claimed the <strong>No Tax on Tips</strong> deduction with an average de=
duction of <strong>over $7,000</strong>
</li>
<li style=3D"-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; li=
ne-height: 1.4; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;=
 color: #000000; text-align: left; margin-bottom: 15px;">
<strong>1.5 million</strong> filers claimed the <strong>No Tax on Made-in-A=
merica Car Loan Interest</strong> with an average benefit of <strong>over $=
1,800</strong>
</li>
</ul>
<p style=3D"-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; lin=
e-height: 1.4; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; =
color: #000000; text-align: left; margin: 0 0 15px;" align=3D"left">America=
ns who claimed these new tax cuts this year received real, meaningful tax r=
elief. If you did not and may be eligible, here is the good news =E2=80=93 =
the no tax on tips, no tax on overtime, no tax on car loan interest, and th=
e enhanced senior deductions are all in place until at least 2028. For more=
 information about these provisions and eligibility requirements, please vi=
sit the <a href=3D"https://links-1.govdelivery.com/CL0/https:%2F%2Fwww.irs.=
gov%2Fnewsroom%2Fone-big-beautiful-bill-provisions-individuals-and-workers/=
1/010001a189a4aa73-c38bdf22-68be-4b81-990f-03e47dc0c461-000000/wuMlC495O1uT=
pPlqaUIxWgV1lcpetAsPHGr0WxBoZPU=3D452" target=3D"_blank" title=3D"https://w=
ww.irs.gov/newsroom/one-big-beautiful-bill-provisions-individuals-and-worke=
rs" data-auth=3D"NotApplicable" data-linkindex=3D"0" rel=3D"noopener" style=
=3D"-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; color: #007=
3AF;">IRS=E2=80=99s Working Families Tax Cuts website</a>.</p>
<p style=3D"-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; lin=
e-height: 1.4; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; =
color: #000000; text-align: left; margin: 0 0 15px;" align=3D"left">With th=
ese new tax cuts in effect, and the dedicated staff at the IRS, we recently=
 completed the most successful tax filing season in history.</p>
<ul type=3D"disc" style=3D"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 15px;">
<li style=3D"-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; li=
ne-height: 1.4; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;=
 color: #000000; text-align: left; margin-top: 0px;">The average refund was=
 11% larger than last year</li>
<li style=3D"-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; li=
ne-height: 1.4; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;=
 color: #000000; text-align: left;">98% of returns were filed electronicall=
y</li>
<li style=3D"-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; li=
ne-height: 1.4; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;=
 color: #000000; text-align: left; margin-bottom: 15px;">Over 90% of refund=
s were issued in less than three weeks</li>
</ul>
<p style=3D"-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; lin=
e-height: 1.4; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; =
color: #000000; text-align: left; margin: 0 0 15px;" align=3D"left">Hardwor=
king Americans like you are keeping more of what they earn because of Presi=
dent Trump=E2=80=99s historic tax cuts.<br><br></p>
<p style=3D"-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; lin=
e-height: 1.4; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; =
color: #000000; text-align: left; margin: 0 0 15px;" align=3D"left">Frank J=
. Bisignano<br>Chief Executive Officer<br>Internal Revenue Service</p>
<p style=3D"-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; lin=
e-height: 1.4; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; =
color: #000000; text-align: left; margin: 0 0 15px;" align=3D"left">=C2=A0<=
/p>
<div>
<p style=3D"-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; lin=
e-height: 1.4; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; =
color: #000000; text-align: left; margin: 0 0 15px;" align=3D"left">NOTE: T=
his e-mail from the Internal Revenue Service is for informational purposes =
and does not constitute a communication about a taxpayer=E2=80=99s specific=
 situation. The IRS does not generally send e-mails to taxpayers.</p>
</div>
